670661Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 12771781443, 'load_duration': 30062119, 'prompt_eval_count': 1588, 'prompt_eval_duration': 222093115, 'eval_count': 608, 'eval_duration': 12518802395, 'model_name': 'codestral:22b'} id='run--d1cdd673-c7db-49bf-84e3-40ddacf95383-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1588, 'output_tokens': 608, 'total_tokens': 2196} 72%|███████▏  | 72/100 [1:24:59<1:10:01, 150.05s/it]
